    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.poster.avif?t=1755273394\" width=546 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.webm?t=1755273394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.mp4?t=1755273394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S THIS 'TIME COWBOY' ABOUT PARTNER!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME COWBOY is a fast-paced movement shooter, where you play as Hank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stubborn Cowboy running and gunning his way through History, trying to find out who is dragging him through it... and how to put a stop to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE GAME!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game as of now includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Levels each set in the Wild West &amp; Medieval Era</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Weapons <i>(Including Fists!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-Inspired Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Enemy\u00a0Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Boss Fights <i>(Includes 1 Secret Boss!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulties: <i>Yellowbelly, Hard and Tuberculosis</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mister Milton</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.poster.avif?t=1755273394\" width=546 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.webm?t=1755273394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824230/extras/f89882305971b6fa65554737dd888b89.mp4?t=1755273394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S THIS 'TIME COWBOY' ABOUT PARTNER!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME COWBOY is a fast-paced movement shooter, where you play as Hank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stubborn Cowboy running and gunning his way through History, trying to find out who is dragging him through it... and how to put a stop to it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE GAME!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game as of now includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Levels each set in the Wild West &amp; Medieval Era</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Weapons <i>(Including Fists!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s-Inspired Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Enemy\u00a0Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Boss Fights <i>(Includes 1 Secret Boss!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulties: <i>Yellowbelly, Hard and Tuberculosis</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mister Milton</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fast-Paced Retro Cowboy FPS where you speed and shoot your way through history as a ticked-off cowboy.",
